      "line_start": 53,
      "line_end": 55,
      "text": "To prevent loss of historical context, memory decay will be handled by a dynamic 'activation' parameter, not by altering the static 'importance' score. This 'activation' value will decrease over time, but highly important items may have a 'floor' value to prevent them from decaying completely.",
